# Preserve pictures across native reattachment, scoped to their Skia API instance.
# Use Display P3 on supported Apple displays by default.
# Synchronize iOS drawRect presentation with Core Animation to address
# frozen frames after navigation. Keep animation-driven frames asynchronous.

